1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,027
Make or do?

2
00:00:01,027 --> 00:00:02,511
Most learners mix them up.

3
00:00:02,511 --> 00:00:03,766
Here is the easy rule.

4
00:00:04,966 --> 00:00:06,436
I need to make my homework.

5
00:00:06,436 --> 00:00:06,817
Almost!

6
00:00:06,817 --> 00:00:07,688
You do homework.

7
00:00:07,688 --> 00:00:09,103
Then why do I make a cake?

8
00:00:09,103 --> 00:00:10,899
Because you create something new!

9
00:00:12,099 --> 00:00:13,859
Make is for creating something.

10
00:00:13,859 --> 00:00:15,278
Do is for tasks and jobs.

11
00:00:15,278 --> 00:00:18,399
So you make a cake, and then, sadly, you do the dishes.

